Subject: [PATCH] Bound mobile PCM feeding and yield on source starvation

Account for route preroll in the queue budget. Limit both renderer lead and
wall-clock consumption, suspend empty callbacks, and serialize transport and
timer teardown. Keep sample timestamps in the synchronizer's clock domain.

